---
layout: page.njk
title: Our programs
subtitle: The initiatives your donations bring to life. Each program is run with local partners and reported on publicly.
---

<div class="grid grid-3">
  {% for program in collections.programs %}
  <article class="card">
    {% if program.data.image %}
    <img class="card-image" src="{{ program.data.image }}" alt="{{ program.data.title }}" loading="lazy">
    {% endif %}
    <div class="card-body">
      <span class="card-tag">{{ program.data.tag }}</span>
      <h3>{{ program.data.title }}</h3>
      <p>{{ program.data.excerpt }}</p>
      <a class="card-link" href="{{ program.url }}">Learn more →</a>
    </div>
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<section class="section center" style="padding-bottom:0;">
  <h2>Want to support a program directly?</h2>
  <p class="muted" style="max-width:560px; margin:0 auto 1.5rem;">Choose a program when you donate, or get in touch and we will direct your gift where it is needed most.</p>
  <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/donate/">Donate now</a>
</section>